              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, alaska\u2019s Megan\u2019s Law makes certain truthful information about convicted sex offenders available to the public to help protect against the risk of re\u2011offense."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c1a9c7ac55a566d481cea94350eaef6b4e96b518768b1d3633069c877da2e5e2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c1a9c7ac55a5-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, one issue raised is whether the information must be generated by acts that occur after the conviction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c1a9c7ac55a566d481cea94350eaef6b4e96b518768b1d3633069c877da2e5e2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c1a9c7ac55a5-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, another issue is whether the registration requirements apply retroactively to offenders convicted before the law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c1a9c7ac55a566d481cea94350eaef6b4e96b518768b1d3633069c877da2e5e2",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c1a9c7ac55a5-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 31,
              "start": 31
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, the Court is asked whether the registration scheme constitutes punishment for ex post facto analysis."
      }
    ],
